flowchart LR
  Root["Root coordinator: select finite recipe and pin inputs"] -->|job config| Parent["ABC canonical runner: GPU0 lease, occupancy, deadline"]
  Parent -->|same process group| Worker["WBC process adapter: verify source, inputs, storage and summary"]
  Source["Pristine R1 controller source + installed WBC runtime"] -->|authenticated original code| Worker
  Data["TRAIN references, teacher data and frozen nominal"] -->|immutable paths and hashes| Worker
  Seed["Optional completed PPO Warp cache + receipt"] -->|pinned read-only source| Worker
  Worker -->|bounded byte copy| Cache["Fresh job private Warp cache"]
  Cache -->|Warp validates cached kernels| Original
  Worker -->|original argv| Original["Original feedback fitter / gated pose PPO / evaluator"]
  Original -->|checkpoint, export, metrics| Artifacts["Canonical run artifacts and worker receipt"]
  Worker -->|completion or failure| Parent
  Parent -->|group cleanup and actual elapsed charge| Receipt["Canonical receipt"]
  Artifacts --> Review["Independent review + root scientific acceptance"]
  Receipt --> Review
  Review --> Report["Measured comparison; no automatic learning claim"]
